Package: vabaxos-radio
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad
Description: Radio over the Internet, from the keyboard
 The stations of Radio Browser, a free catalog without accounts: the
 most listened in Italy at the start, search by name or by kind (jazz,
 news), all the world on request, favourites. Enter plays; Ctrl+I says the
 song on air when the station sends it; Ctrl+P stops and plays again;
 Ctrl+Up and Ctrl+Down the volume; Ctrl+D the favourite.
